# Every image builds with the repo root as context (docker-compose.yml) but
# only COPYs specific paths. Keep secrets and bulky local state out of the
# build context entirely -- it is sent to the Docker daemon even if never
# copied into an image.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.production.example
.git
**/node_modules
.next
**/dist
test-results
playwright-report
*.tsbuildinfo
*.log
.storage
tmp
.claude
.agents
TASKS
docs
